    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d444">

                <pb facs="0616" n="520" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg520"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Acting British consul-general
                        to United States legation.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tabriz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 6.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Bagdasarian has reached and is still a prisoner. Emir-i-Nizam appears to take no
                    notice of instructions sent him. I shall take measures to-morrow and report.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
